      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perrysburg%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 19th‑century hydraulic canal diverted river water to power grist, saw, tannery, furniture, paper, and machine shops along the waterfront.",
